{"id":"sut_","lemma":"суть","pos":"noun","rank":1024,"glosses":["essence, core, gist, main point"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c6/Ru-%D1%81%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%83%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"сути","plural":"сути"},"examples":[{"text":"Это суть проблемы.","en":"This is the core of the problem.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"problem","l":"проблема"}]},{"text":"Что это, по сути, означает?","en":"What does it actually mean?","words":[null,null,{"g":"along / by"},null,{"g":"to mean, to signify","l":"означать"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"why"]]},{"text":"Я, кажется, понял суть.","en":"I think I get the idea.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"apparently, it seems"},{"g":"to understand","l":"понять"},null]},{"text":"В этом, по сути, нет смысла.","en":"That doesn't really make sense.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"along / by"},null,{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"sense, meaning","l":"смысл"}]},{"text":"В этом-то и суть.","en":"That's precisely the point.","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"and"},null]}]}